From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 12:24:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] editor: overlay decals are laid on the terrain in cells (no
 skew up close, follow the slope), EdOverlayGeom.h + test

ed_overlay_decal drew one flat quad at the given height: it cut through the ground on slopes and, seen from close by, the linear interpolation of the
picture over one big screen quad skewed it. The decal is now a grid of cells on the height field (bilinear ground, cell size by terrain and by screen size).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01F37er45a7etRuMgEW1q3kY

